#nonbond(12-6) ff94

> E = eps(ij) * [(rmin(ij)/r(ij))**12 - 2 * (rmin(ij)/r(ij))**6]
> rmin(ij) = (rmin(i) + rmin(j)) / 2 = R*(i) + R*(j)
> eps(ij) = sqrt(eps(i) * eps(j))
> rmin(i) is the like-pair minimum distance, twice the R* of the Amber parameter files

